n</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.800" end="00:24.810"><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:22.950">You </span><span begin="00:22.950" end="00:23.190">are </span><span begin="00:23.190" end="00:23.250">the </span><span begin="00:23.250" end="00:23.850">queen </span><span begin="00:23.850" end="00:23.970">of </span><span begin="00:23.970" end="00:24.810">runaround</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.870" end="00:27.420"><span begin="00:24.870" end="00:25.350">You </span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.920">know </span><span begin="00:25.920" end="00:26.400">it's </span><span begin="00:26.400" end="00:27.420">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.320" end="00:29.250"><span begin="00:28.320" end="00:28.470">You </span><span begin="00:28.470" end="00:28.680">chew </span><span begin="00:28.680" end="00:28.920">me </span><span begin="00:28.920" end="00:29.250">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.250" end="00:30.420"><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.340">And </span><span begin="00:29.340" end="00:29.550">spit </span><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.730">me </span><span begin="00:29.730" end="00:30.420">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.140" end="00:32.070"><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:31.500">Enjoy </span><span begin="00:31.500" end="00:31.620">the </span><span begin="00:31.620" end="00:32.070">taste</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.070" end="00:33.630"><span begin="00:32.070" end="00:32.160">I </span><span begin="00:32.160" end="00:32.400">leave </span><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.550">in </span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:32.670">your </span><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:33.630">mouth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.830"><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.050">You </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:34.320">look </span><span begin="00:34.320" end="00:34.440">at </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.830">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.830" end="00:35.910"><span b